#: ../../library/omv.image.Line.rst:4
msgid "class Line -- Line object"
msgstr "class Line -- Line 对象"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Line.rst:6
msgid ""
"The line object is an `attrtuple "
"<https://docs.micropython.org/en/latest/library/collections.html#collections.namedtuple>`_"
" returned by `Image.find_lines()`, `Image.find_line_segments()`, and "
"`Image.get_regression()`. It represents a single oriented line segment with "
"both its endpoint form ``(x1, y1) -- (x2, y2)`` and its Hough-space form "
"``(rho, theta)``."
msgstr ""
"line 对象是由 `Image.find_lines()`\\ 、\\ `Image.find_line_segments()` 和 "
"`Image.get_regression()` 返回的 `attrtuple "
"<https://docs.micropython.org/en/latest/library/collections.html#collections.namedtuple>`_\\"
" 。它表示单条有向线段，同时具有端点形式 ``(x1, y1) -- (x2, y2)`` 和霍夫空间形式 ``(rho, theta)``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Line.rst:12
msgid ""
"Fields are accessible by attribute name (``line.x1``) or by index "
"(``line[0]``). The object has no public constructor."
msgstr "字段可通过属性名（\\ ``line.x1``\\ ）或索引（\\ ``line[0]``\\ ）访问。该对象没有公开的构造函数。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Line.rst:17
msgid ""
"Please call `Image.find_lines()`, `Image.find_line_segments()`, or "
"`Image.get_regression()` to create this object."
msgstr ""
"请调用 `Image.find_lines()`\\ 、\\ `Image.find_line_segments()` 或 "
"`Image.get_regression()` 来创建该对象。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Line.rst:22
msgid "X coordinate of the first endpoint. Integer. Index ``[0]``."
msgstr "第一个端点的 X 坐标。整数。索引 ``[0]``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Line.rst:26
msgid "Y coordinate of the first endpoint. Integer. Index ``[1]``."
msgstr "第一个端点的 Y 坐标。整数。索引 ``[1]``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Line.rst:30
msgid "X coordinate of the second endpoint. Integer. Index ``[2]``."
msgstr "第二个端点的 X 坐标。整数。索引 ``[2]``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Line.rst:34
msgid "Y coordinate of the second endpoint. Integer. Index ``[3]``."
msgstr "第二个端点的 Y 坐标。整数。索引 ``[3]``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Line.rst:38
msgid ""
"Pixel length of the segment: ``round(sqrt((x2-x1)**2 + (y2-y1)**2))``. "
"Integer. Index ``[4]``."
msgstr "线段的像素长度：\\ ``round(sqrt((x2-x1)**2 + (y2-y1)**2))``\\ 。整数。索引 ``[4]``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Line.rst:43
msgid ""
"Magnitude of the line in Hough-space. Higher values indicate that more edge "
"pixels voted for this line. Integer. Index ``[5]``."
msgstr "霍夫空间中该线的幅值。值越大表示有越多的边缘像素为这条线投票。整数。索引 ``[5]``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Line.rst:48
msgid ""
"Angle of the line in Hough-space, in degrees, 0 -- 179. Integer. Index "
"``[6]``."
msgstr "霍夫空间中该线的角度，单位为度，范围 0 -- 179。整数。索引 ``[6]``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Line.rst:53
msgid ""
"Distance of the line from the image origin in Hough-space, in pixels. Signed"
" integer (can be negative). Index ``[7]``."
msgstr "霍夫空间中该线到图像原点的距离，单位为像素。有符号整数（可为负）。索引 ``[7]``\\ 。"
